.Dd July 17, 2026
.Dt RETICULUM-GO-PATH 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm reticulum-go-path , rgopath
.Nd manage Reticulum paths and blackholes
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm reticulum-go Cm path
.Op Fl config Ar dir
.Op Fl t
.Op Fl d
.Op Fl D
.Op Fl q
.Op Fl blackholed
.Op Fl blackhole
.Op Fl unblackhole
.Op Ar hash
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Shows or modifies the path table and blackhole list via shared-instance RPC,
or performs a local path request when no RPC mode flag is set.
.Pp
Run with
.Fl h
for the full flag list.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr reticulum-go 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Quad4.io
